The face models of `appearances`

This artifact holds two ONNX models that OpenCV Zoo publishes, as the
files OpenCV Zoo publishes them, with no conversion. `liken` did not
train or change either model. Each model keeps its own license, and
the license file beside each model is the one OpenCV Zoo publishes in
that model's directory.

The files come from https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo at commit
47534e27c9851bb1128ccc0102f1145e27f23f98.

face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx

  YuNet, a face detector, by Shiqi Yu and the contributors of
  https://github.com/ShiqiYu/libfacedetection.train. OpenCV Zoo
  publishes it in models/face_detection_yunet/.
  License: MIT, in face_detection_yunet_2023mar.LICENSE.
  Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu <shiqi.yu@gmail.com>.

face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx

  SFace, a face embedding model, by Yaoyao Zhong
  (https://github.com/zhongyy/SFace), from the paper "SFace:
  Sigmoid-Constrained Hypersphere Loss for Robust Face Recognition"
  (https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.12010). Chengrui Wang converted it to
  ONNX for OpenCV Zoo, which publishes it in
  models/face_recognition_sface/.
  License: Apache 2.0, in face_recognition_sface_2021dec.LICENSE.
